# Cloudflare Workers static-assets headers for damiao-motor.jia-xie.com.
#
# This site is served by an assets-only Worker (no Worker script), so a
# _headers file applies — unlike jia-xie.com, where the entry Worker means
# headers have to be set in code. Keep it that way.
#
# MkDocs Material fingerprints its own bundles (bundle.<hash>.min.js), so those
# are safe to cache forever. HTML stays revalidating so doc edits go live at
# once.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=300

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/javascripts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/*.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/*.jpg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/*.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
